{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1466"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge everyday/food","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/everyday__food.g3.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",46],["-","painter"],["+","painter,"],["=",1],["-","and "],["=",6],["+","and an Italian restaurateur in Mexico "],["=",718],["+","Caesar salad has nothing to do with Rome. Its namesake is Caesar Cardini, an Italian immigrant who ran restaurants in San Diego and, because Prohibition kept Americans thirsty, a restaurant called Caesar's across the border in Tijuana. According to the account of his daughter, he improvised the salad there on 4 July 1924, when a holiday rush had emptied his kitchen: romaine lettuce, croutons, Parmesan and a dressing of egg, olive oil, lemon juice, garlic and Worcestershire sauce, tossed at the table.\n\n"],["=",139],["+","\n| Caesar salad | Restaurateur Caesar Cardini | Tijuana, 1924 |"],["=",46]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",38],["-","Maler"],["+","Maler,"],["=",1],["-","und "],["=",6],["+","und ein italienischer Wirt in Mexiko "],["=",680],["+","Der Caesar-Salat hat mit Rom nichts zu tun. Sein Namensgeber ist Caesar Cardini, ein italienischer Einwanderer, der Restaurants in San Diego führte und, weil die Prohibition die Amerikaner durstig hielt, jenseits der Grenze in Tijuana ein Lokal namens Caesar's. Nach der Erzählung seiner Tochter improvisierte er den Salat dort am 4. Juli 1924, als der Feiertagsandrang seine Küche geleert hatte: Römersalat, Croûtons, Parmesan und ein Dressing aus Ei, Olivenöl, Zitronensaft, Knoblauch und Worcestershiresauce, am Tisch angemacht.\n\n"],["=",133],["+","\n| Caesar-Salat | Wirt Caesar Cardini | Tijuana, 1924 |"],["=",46]]},{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["=",69],["+"," The date 4 July 1924 for the Caesar salad is the traditional account from Cardini's daughter."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["=",77],["+"," Das Datum 4. Juli 1924 für den Caesar-Salat ist die überlieferte Erzählung von Cardinis Tochter."]]}]},
